      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "content": "# dsh-subagent-role-router bundle patch: one host plugin row that registers\n# the `dsh-subagent-role-router` settings section and wraps the host subagents\n# service, so every delegation without an explicit `agentOptions` (the stock\n# `subagent` / `subagent_fork` tools and any other tool that omits model or\n# provider) runs the child on the configured route.\n- insert:\n    - id: dsh-subagent-role-router\n      name: 'dsh-subagent-role-router'\n"
